  "draft_py": "# Rabid Bite: Garruk, Savage Herald's [-2] body (\"Target creature you control deals damage equal to\n# its power to another target creature\") with Hunter's Edge's second target \"target creature you\n# don't control\", as the sorcery's effect. The compiler gave no tree at all.\nyours = Selector(\n    count=QConst(value=1),\n    mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n    filter=FAnd(children=(\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n        FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n    )),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\nabilities = [\n    SpellAbility(\n        kind=SpellKind.SORCERY,\n        effect=A(Verb.DEAL_DAMAGE, {\n            'amount': QProp(referent=yours, field=QPropField.POWER),\n            'dealer': yours,\n            'target': Selector(\n                count=QConst(value=1),\n                mode=SelectorMode.TARGET,\n                filter=FAnd(children=(\n                    FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n                    FNot(inner=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU)),\n                )),\n                zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n            ),\n        }),\n    ),\n]\n",
